# ── FIBO Integration Scheme (RH ruling 2026-07-24) ──────────────────────────────
# FIBO is IN-SCOPE EXTERNAL (the BFO/CCO posture): never managed nor extended by us,
# leveraged extensively — our SDG ontology enriches with full appreciation for what
# FIBO provides. FIBO's own SKOS vocabulary declares NO topConceptOf/hasTopConcept
# (a ~450-root FOREST — the §4.6.3 atypical presentation, measured); we therefore
# author OUR OWN entry point: sdg:FinancialSector (the single logical top) →
# sdg:FINTECH (genus-level: broader ∧ narrower AT BIRTH; chord-conformant ALL-CAPS
# fragment per RH 2026-07-25) → a curated ~20-concept
# subset of high-value FIBO roots, each skos:closeMatch-mapped to its official IRI
# (closeMatch, NOT exactMatch: non-transitive by design — our curated concepts may
# carry governance annotations and composite texts; equivalence must not propagate
# across third-party mapping chains). Layer A (zero-copy membership, SKOS Primer
# §3.2): the official FIBO IRIs are asserted skos:inScheme this scheme — nothing
# replicated; consumers resolve at source.
#
# NOT IN THE APERTURE SEED PATH: this file is deliberately separate from
# domain_concepts.ttl — these concepts become admission anchors only through the
# staged → selectivity-delta → enumerated-exclusion → shadow → armed discipline.
# FND/Law/LegalCore/Law is OMITTED pending census capture (confirmed-links: the
# census is our record of consumption; 20/21 curated roots resolved against it).
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
@prefix skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix owl:  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix dct:  <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .
@prefix sdg:  <https://signals.zndx.org/sdg#> .

# TopQuadrant thin-subclass pattern: the attachment point for governance
# annotations (data-classification, retention, review status) on FIBO-aligned terms.
sdg:FIBOConcept rdfs:subClassOf skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "FIBO-aligned Concept" ;
    skos:definition "A curated SDG concept aligned to the Financial Industry Business Ontology; carries SDG governance annotations while the mapped FIBO concept remains external and authoritative for its own definition." .

# ── THE TOPIC-DOMAINS TIER (RH 2026-07-25): instantiation, NOT specialization ──
# TopicDomain-hood is a role the sector concepts PLAY, not a genus above them — a
# broader-apex conflates instantiation with specialization (OntoClean) and makes
# one false root over what is truly a FOREST. Two legs, one checkable
# correspondence:
#   SKOS leg: sdg:TopicDomains (skos:Collection — disjoint from Concept AND
#             ConceptScheme by the SKOS data model, so it structurally CANNOT
#             become a root) holds the sector members for navigation/faceting.
#   OWL leg:  sdg:TopicDomainConcept (fresh-IRI thin class, TopQuadrant pattern)
#             types the same concepts for axioms that quantify over sectors.
# SYNC: members(sdg:TopicDomains) ≡ instances(sdg:TopicDomainConcept) — measured
# by the contract driver (a triad-shaped OWL ⊨ SKOS correspondence). The
# Collection disjointness is the standing signal to Atlas curators: richer
# conceptual frameworks belong in HermiT/kvasir-checked OWL, never in SKOS
# hierarchy claims. (Naming: the Topic- qualifier avoids the rdfs:domain
# collision and resonates with the topic layer — topics ≡ aperture anchors.)
sdg:TopicDomainConcept rdfs:subClassOf skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Topic Domain Concept" ;
    skos:definition "A sector-tier concept playing the topic-domain role: a forest top organizing one topical sector (financial, healthcare, heavy-industrial, …) with NO shared parent — topic-domain-hood is instantiation of this class plus membership in sdg:TopicDomains, never a broader link." .

sdg:TopicDomains a skos:Collection ;
    skos:prefLabel "Topic Domains" ;
    skos:definition "The cross-scheme grouping of the sector-tier forest tops: grouping WITHOUT hierarchy (skos:Collection is disjoint from Concept and ConceptScheme) — the financial, healthcare, and heavy-industrial topic domains stay parallel and jointly navigable with no apex above them." ;
    skos:member sdg:FinancialSector , sdg:Healthcare , sdg:HeavyIndustries .

# deprecated bridge (reference resolution only, never re-linked): the former
# Concept-typed apex made a single false root over the forest
sdg:TopicDomain a skos:Concept ;
    owl:deprecated true ;
    dct:isReplacedBy sdg:TopicDomains ;
    skos:prefLabel "Topic Domain" ;
    skos:editorialNote "Retired 2026-07-25 (RH): apex-as-Concept conflated instantiation with specialization; replaced by the sdg:TopicDomains Collection (SKOS leg) + sdg:TopicDomainConcept thin class (OWL leg)." .

sdg:FIBOIntegrationScheme a skos:ConceptScheme ;
    rdfs:label "FIBO Integration Scheme" ;
    skos:definition "Curated entry point into selected FIBO concepts for use within Signals Data Governance." ;
    skos:hasTopConcept sdg:FinancialSector .

sdg:FinancialSector a skos:Concept, sdg:FIBOConcept, sdg:TopicDomainConcept ;
    skos:prefLabel "Financial Sector" ;
    skos:altLabel "FinancialSector" ;
    skos:notation "15" ;
    skos:definition "The single logical top for financial-industry terminology within SDG: the discoverable entry point over FIBO-aligned concepts, organizing without admitting. A sector-tier forest top (sdg:TopicDomainConcept, member of sdg:TopicDomains) — no parent above it." ;
    skos:topConceptOf sdg:FIBOIntegrationScheme ;
    skos:inScheme sdg:FIBOIntegrationScheme .

sdg:FINTECH a skos:Concept, sdg:FIBOConcept ;
    skos:prefLabel "FinTech" ;
    skos:altLabel "FINTECH" , "Financial Industry Concepts" , "FIBO-aligned Concepts" ;
    skos:notation "15.1" ;
    skos:definition "Top-level concept grouping financial industry and FinTech-related terminology, primarily drawn from or aligned with the Financial Industry Business Ontology (FIBO)." ;
    skos:scopeNote "Covers the foundational financial constructs — agreements, contracts, and legal constructs binding parties; assets, ownership, and control; monetary amounts and occurrences — and the instruments built on them: financial instruments spanning securities, debt instruments, equity instruments, and derivative instruments with their underliers; the market and service fabric of exchanges, financial services, accounts, pools, and collateral. Terminology traces to FIBO's Foundations (FND), Business & Commerce (FBC), Securities (SEC), and Derivatives (DER) modules." ;
    skos:broader sdg:FinancialSector ;
    skos:inScheme sdg:FIBOIntegrationScheme .

# ── the curated subset (Core FND + FBC/SEC/DER roots) ───────────────────────────

sdg:FIN_AGREEMENT a skos:Concept, sdg:FIBOConcept ;
    skos:prefLabel "Agreement" ;
    skos:altLabel "FIN_AGREEMENT" ;
    skos:notation "15.1.1" ;
    skos:definition "A negotiated and typically legally enforceable understanding between parties — the foundational construct beneath contracts, commitments, and financial arrangements." ;
    skos:broader sdg:FINTECH ;
    skos:inScheme sdg:FIBOIntegrationScheme ;
    skos:closeMatch <https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FND/Agreements/Agreements/Agreement> .

sdg:FIN_CONTRACT a skos:Concept, sdg:FIBOConcept ;
    skos:prefLabel "Contract" ;
    skos:altLabel "FIN_CONTRACT" ;
    skos:notation "15.1.2" ;
    skos:definition "A voluntary, deliberate agreement between competent parties creating binding obligations — the instrumented form financial products and services take." ;
    skos:broader sdg:FINTECH ;
    skos:inScheme sdg:FIBOIntegrationScheme ;
    skos:closeMatch <https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FND/Agreements/Contracts/Contract> .

sdg:FIN_ASSET a skos:Concept, sdg:FIBOConcept ;
    skos:prefLabel "Asset" ;
    skos:altLabel "FIN_ASSET" ;
    skos:notation "15.1.3" ;
    skos:definition "Anything of monetary value owned or controlled by a party, tangible or intangible, appearing on balance sheets and as the subject of ownership and transfer." ;
    skos:broader sdg:FINTECH ;
    skos:inScheme sdg:FIBOIntegrationScheme ;
    skos:closeMatch <https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FND/OwnershipAndControl/Ownership/Asset> .

sdg:FIN_MONETARY_AMOUNT a skos:Concept, sdg:FIBOConcept ;
    skos:prefLabel "Monetary Amount" ;
    skos:altLabel "FIN_MONETARY_AMOUNT" ;
    skos:notation "15.1.4" ;
    skos:definition "A quantity of money expressed in a specific currency — the measured value carried by prices, balances, fees, and settlements." ;
    skos:broader sdg:FINTECH ;
    skos:inScheme sdg:FIBOIntegrationScheme ;
    skos:closeMatch <https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FND/Accounting/CurrencyAmount/MonetaryAmount> .

sdg:FIN_PERSON a skos:Concept, sdg:FIBOConcept ;
    skos:prefLabel "Person" ;
    skos:altLabel "FIN_PERSON" ;
    skos:notation "15.1.5" ;
    skos:definition "A natural person as a financial actor — account holder, beneficial owner, executive, or counterparty — distinct from legal entities constructed by law." ;
    skos:broader sdg:FINTECH ;
    skos:inScheme sdg:FIBOIntegrationScheme ;
    skos:closeMatch <https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FND/AgentsAndPeople/People/Person> .

sdg:FIN_LEGAL_CONSTRUCT a skos:Concept, sdg:FIBOConcept ;
    skos:prefLabel "Legal Construct" ;
    skos:altLabel "FIN_LEGAL_CONSTRUCT" ;
    skos:notation "15.1.6" ;
    skos:definition "Something created and recognized through the operation of law — capacities, statuses, and instruments whose existence is juridical rather than material." ;
    skos:broader sdg:FINTECH ;
    skos:inScheme sdg:FIBOIntegrationScheme ;
    skos:closeMatch <https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FND/Law/LegalCapacity/LegalConstruct> .

sdg:FIN_OCCURRENCE a skos:Concept, sdg:FIBOConcept ;
    skos:prefLabel "Occurrence" ;
    skos:altLabel "FIN_OCCURRENCE" ;
    skos:notation "15.1.7" ;
    skos:definition "An event or happening realized at some time — trade executions, corporate actions, defaults, and lifecycle transitions as recorded financial history." ;
    skos:broader sdg:FINTECH ;
    skos:inScheme sdg:FIBOIntegrationScheme ;
    skos:closeMatch <https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FND/DatesAndTimes/Occurrences/Occurrence> .

sdg:FIN_OWNERSHIP a skos:Concept, sdg:FIBOConcept ;
    skos:prefLabel "Ownership" ;
    skos:altLabel "FIN_OWNERSHIP" ;
    skos:notation "15.1.8" ;
    skos:definition "The situation of holding rights in an asset — the relation between owner and owned that transfers, divides, and encumbers through financial activity." ;
    skos:broader sdg:FINTECH ;
    skos:inScheme sdg:FIBOIntegrationScheme ;
    skos:closeMatch <https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FND/OwnershipAndControl/Ownership/Ownership> .

sdg:FIN_CONTROL a skos:Concept, sdg:FIBOConcept ;
    skos:prefLabel "Control" ;
    skos:altLabel "FIN_CONTROL" ;
    skos:notation "15.1.9" ;
    skos:definition "The power to direct or restrict an entity or asset — de jure or de facto — central to consolidation, beneficial ownership, and regulatory perimeters." ;
    skos:broader sdg:FINTECH ;
    skos:inScheme sdg:FIBOIntegrationScheme ;
    skos:closeMatch <https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FND/OwnershipAndControl/Control/Control> .

sdg:FIN_FINANCIAL_INSTRUMENT a skos:Concept, sdg:FIBOConcept ;
    skos:prefLabel "Financial Instrument" ;
    skos:altLabel "FIN_FINANCIAL_INSTRUMENT" ;
    skos:notation "15.1.10" ;
    skos:definition "A written or electronic contract giving rise to both a financial asset of one party and a financial liability or equity instrument of another." ;
    skos:broader sdg:FINTECH ;
    skos:inScheme sdg:FIBOIntegrationScheme ;
    skos:closeMatch <https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FBC/FinancialInstruments/FinancialInstruments/FinancialInstrument> .

sdg:FIN_SECURITY a skos:Concept, sdg:FIBOConcept ;
    skos:prefLabel "Security" ;
    skos:altLabel "FIN_SECURITY" ;
    skos:notation "15.1.11" ;
    skos:definition "A tradable financial instrument representing debt, equity, or rights thereto, typically fungible and issued under a regulated framework." ;
    skos:broader sdg:FINTECH ;
    skos:inScheme sdg:FIBOIntegrationScheme ;
    skos:closeMatch <https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FBC/FinancialInstruments/FinancialInstruments/Security> .

sdg:FIN_DEBT_INSTRUMENT a skos:Concept, sdg:FIBOConcept ;
    skos:prefLabel "Debt Instrument" ;
    skos:altLabel "FIN_DEBT_INSTRUMENT" ;
    skos:notation "15.1.12" ;
    skos:definition "An instrument evidencing a creditor relationship — an obligation to repay borrowed value, with bonds, notes, and loans as principal kinds." ;
    skos:broader sdg:FINTECH ;
    skos:inScheme sdg:FIBOIntegrationScheme ;
    skos:closeMatch <https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FBC/FinancialInstruments/FinancialInstruments/DebtInstrument> .

sdg:FIN_EQUITY_INSTRUMENT a skos:Concept, sdg:FIBOConcept ;
    skos:prefLabel "Equity Instrument" ;
    skos:altLabel "FIN_EQUITY_INSTRUMENT" ;
    skos:notation "15.1.13" ;
    skos:definition "An instrument evidencing residual ownership interest in an entity after liabilities — shares and equity participations conferring owner rights." ;
    skos:broader sdg:FINTECH ;
    skos:inScheme sdg:FIBOIntegrationScheme ;
    skos:closeMatch <https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FBC/FinancialInstruments/FinancialInstruments/EquityInstrument> .

sdg:FIN_DERIVATIVE_INSTRUMENT a skos:Concept, sdg:FIBOConcept ;
    skos:prefLabel "Derivative Instrument" ;
    skos:altLabel "FIN_DERIVATIVE_INSTRUMENT" ;
    skos:notation "15.1.14" ;
    skos:definition "An instrument whose value derives from one or more underliers — options, futures, swaps, and forwards as risk-transfer contracts." ;
    skos:broader sdg:FINTECH ;
    skos:inScheme sdg:FIBOIntegrationScheme ;
    skos:closeMatch <https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FBC/FinancialInstruments/FinancialInstruments/DerivativeInstrument> .

sdg:FIN_UNDERLIER a skos:Concept, sdg:FIBOConcept ;
    skos:prefLabel "Underlier" ;
    skos:altLabel "FIN_UNDERLIER" ;
    skos:notation "15.1.15" ;
    skos:definition "The asset, rate, index, or instrument from which a derivative's value is determined — the reference the contract is written over." ;
    skos:broader sdg:FINTECH ;
    skos:inScheme sdg:FIBOIntegrationScheme ;
    skos:closeMatch <https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FBC/FinancialInstruments/FinancialInstruments/Underlier> .

sdg:FIN_EXCHANGE a skos:Concept, sdg:FIBOConcept ;
    skos:prefLabel "Exchange" ;
    skos:altLabel "FIN_EXCHANGE" ;
    skos:notation "15.1.16" ;
    skos:definition "An organized marketplace operating facilities for listing, trading, and price discovery in securities and other instruments." ;
    skos:broader sdg:FINTECH ;
    skos:inScheme sdg:FIBOIntegrationScheme ;
    skos:closeMatch <https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FBC/FunctionalEntities/Markets/Exchange> .

sdg:FIN_FINANCIAL_SERVICE a skos:Concept, sdg:FIBOConcept ;
    skos:prefLabel "Financial Service" ;
    skos:altLabel "FIN_FINANCIAL_SERVICE" ;
    skos:notation "15.1.17" ;
    skos:definition "A service provided by the financial sector — banking, payments, custody, advisory, underwriting — as the offered counterpart of financial products." ;
    skos:broader sdg:FINTECH ;
    skos:inScheme sdg:FIBOIntegrationScheme ;
    skos:closeMatch <https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FBC/ProductsAndServices/FinancialProductsAndServices/FinancialService> .

sdg:FIN_ACCOUNT a skos:Concept, sdg:FIBOConcept ;
    skos:prefLabel "Account" ;
    skos:altLabel "FIN_ACCOUNT" ;
    skos:notation "15.1.18" ;
    skos:definition "A provider-maintained record of financial relationships and balances for a client — the container through which services are delivered and value moves." ;
    skos:broader sdg:FINTECH ;
    skos:inScheme sdg:FIBOIntegrationScheme ;
    skos:closeMatch <https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FBC/ProductsAndServices/ClientsAndAccounts/Account> .

sdg:FIN_POOL a skos:Concept, sdg:FIBOConcept ;
    skos:prefLabel "Pool" ;
    skos:altLabel "FIN_POOL" ;
    skos:notation "15.1.19" ;
    skos:definition "A collection of assets or obligations aggregated for issuance, securitization, or collective management — the structured grouping beneath asset-backed instruments." ;
    skos:broader sdg:FINTECH ;
    skos:inScheme sdg:FIBOIntegrationScheme ;
    skos:closeMatch <https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/SEC/Securities/Pools/Pool> .

sdg:FIN_COLLATERAL a skos:Concept, sdg:FIBOConcept ;
    skos:prefLabel "Collateral" ;
    skos:altLabel "FIN_COLLATERAL" ;
    skos:notation "15.1.20" ;
    skos:definition "Assets pledged to secure an obligation, transferable to the creditor upon default — the risk-mitigating counterpart of credit exposure." ;
    skos:broader sdg:FINTECH ;
    skos:inScheme sdg:FIBOIntegrationScheme ;
    skos:closeMatch <https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FBC/DebtAndEquities/Debt/Collateral> .

# ── Layer A: zero-copy membership (SKOS Primer §3.2) — the official FIBO IRIs are
# members of this scheme; nothing replicated, consumers resolve at source. ──
<https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FND/Agreements/Agreements/Agreement> skos:inScheme sdg:FIBOIntegrationScheme .
<https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FND/Agreements/Contracts/Contract> skos:inScheme sdg:FIBOIntegrationScheme .
<https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FND/OwnershipAndControl/Ownership/Asset> skos:inScheme sdg:FIBOIntegrationScheme .
<https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FND/Accounting/CurrencyAmount/MonetaryAmount> skos:inScheme sdg:FIBOIntegrationScheme .
<https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FND/AgentsAndPeople/People/Person> skos:inScheme sdg:FIBOIntegrationScheme .
<https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FND/Law/LegalCapacity/LegalConstruct> skos:inScheme sdg:FIBOIntegrationScheme .
<https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FND/DatesAndTimes/Occurrences/Occurrence> skos:inScheme sdg:FIBOIntegrationScheme .
<https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FND/OwnershipAndControl/Ownership/Ownership> skos:inScheme sdg:FIBOIntegrationScheme .
<https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FND/OwnershipAndControl/Control/Control> skos:inScheme sdg:FIBOIntegrationScheme .
<https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FBC/FinancialInstruments/FinancialInstruments/FinancialInstrument> skos:inScheme sdg:FIBOIntegrationScheme .
<https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FBC/FinancialInstruments/FinancialInstruments/Security> skos:inScheme sdg:FIBOIntegrationScheme .
<https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FBC/FinancialInstruments/FinancialInstruments/DebtInstrument> skos:inScheme sdg:FIBOIntegrationScheme .
<https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FBC/FinancialInstruments/FinancialInstruments/EquityInstrument> skos:inScheme sdg:FIBOIntegrationScheme .
<https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FBC/FinancialInstruments/FinancialInstruments/DerivativeInstrument> skos:inScheme sdg:FIBOIntegrationScheme .
<https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FBC/FinancialInstruments/FinancialInstruments/Underlier> skos:inScheme sdg:FIBOIntegrationScheme .
<https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FBC/FunctionalEntities/Markets/Exchange> skos:inScheme sdg:FIBOIntegrationScheme .
<https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FBC/ProductsAndServices/FinancialProductsAndServices/FinancialService> skos:inScheme sdg:FIBOIntegrationScheme .
<https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FBC/ProductsAndServices/ClientsAndAccounts/Account> skos:inScheme sdg:FIBOIntegrationScheme .
<https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/SEC/Securities/Pools/Pool> skos:inScheme sdg:FIBOIntegrationScheme .
<https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FBC/DebtAndEquities/Debt/Collateral> skos:inScheme sdg:FIBOIntegrationScheme .
